\nWe need to decide our recommendation. Could stay with B, but we might propose D as alternative due to strong problem solving and responsibility, but moodiness is a concern. Or propose C due to quick decision making and attention, but communication issues.\n\nGiven the criteria, crew cooperation and communication are critical. B has interpersonal concerns. C also has communication difficulty and egocentric. D is moody and loner. A is unfriendly. All have some concerns. B seems strongest overall despite concerns. So we may support B, but ask for more evidence about B's interpersonal remarks and how they affect crew. Also maybe ask about D's moodiness.\n\nThus our public message: I agree with Agent 2's provisional recommendation for Candidate B, but I want to highlight that while B's technical and stress resilience are strong, the interpersonal concerns could be mitigated; we need concrete examples. Also compare with other candidates: D has excellent problem solving and responsibility, but moodiness and being a loner may be more severe for crew cooperation. C's quick decision making is good but communication issues are serious. A's leadership and anticipation are good but unfriendly and unhealthy habits raise reliability concerns.\n\nThus I maintain vote for B, pending clarification.\n\nLet's craft message.\n\nMetadata JSON: vote \"Candidate B\"."}
